      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KATE'S RIFT (2) was quickly out of the boxes with a slick early sectional clocking 22.53 with a 3 length win at Ballarat over 390m. Comes through a solid form race last start. Expected to measure up again. PAY UP SALLY (3) goes very well at the course and distance with four wins and a placing from 10 starts. Placed last time (22.71) at Shepparton in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten 5 lengths. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. MORAINE QUINN (1) finished third (23.01) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Form here at the trip sound including five wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and seven minor placings to her name from 16 starts. Should be thereabouts. SAINT MICK (5) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
